ookbook:Chili Powder|chili powder]]\n*3 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Garlic Powder|garlic powder]]\n*8 [[Cookbook:Ounce|ounces]] (225 g) tomato sauce\n*3 [[Cookbook:Tortilla|tortillas]] in bits\n*3 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] shredded [[Cookbook:Cheese|cheese]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#Brown the ground beef in [[Cookbook:Frying Pan|skillet]] on medium heat.\n#Drain the ground beef.\n#Dump the ground beef back in the skillet.\n#While on medium heat mix in the taco seasoning, the chili powder, the garlic powder, and the tomato sauce.\n#[[Cookbook:Simmering|Simmer]] for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally. \n#Mix the ground beef mixture, tortilla bits, and the cheese together in a [[Cookbook:Baking Dish|casserole dish]].\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] in oven at [[Cookbook:Oven Temperatures|375°F]] (190°C) for 20 minutes.\n#Serve hot.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using ground beef]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tortilla]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Tex-Mex recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chili powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic powder]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Taco Casserole","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 pound (450 g) ground beef","sourceText":"1 pound (450 g) ground beef","amountText":"1 pound (450 g) ground beef","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 taco seasoning packet","sourceText":"1 taco seasoning packet","amountText":"1 taco seasoning packet","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 tablespoons chili powder","sourceText":"3 tablespoons chili powder","amountText":"3 tablespoons chili powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"3 tablespoons garlic powder","sourceText":"3 tablespoons garlic powder","amountText":"3 tablespoons garlic powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"